# two calls of `start` have returned before either `later` goes on: each finds the `held` of its own scope
# LIBRARY: own
# RUN(SHELL): run-in-shell globalThis.sink = start => { start(1).then(print); start(2).then(print); start(3).then(print); };
# SHELL: 1
# SHELL-NEXT: 2
# SHELL-NEXT: 3
# SHELL-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(FORM): walk f2:CoroutineBody mechanisms=all
# FORM: MarkEnvironmentEscaped
# PROGRAM-OF: ../walk/escape-analysis/body-of-a-coroutine-marks-the-environment-that-it-is-handed.ir
